 jeans, and scuffed white sneakers; black-rimmed glasses.\n夜影: Short, sleek black fur covering the entire body, glossy in the light., Golden vertical slit pupils, sharp and contemptuous expression, left ear has a visible notch; sleek whiskers., Lean and agile cat body, medium-sized, with a tail that can transform into a golden light chain; when burning life, golden flames envelop the whole form., wearing No clothing; natural black fur only.\n小雨: Long dark hair tied into a neat high ponytail, with a few loose strands framing her face., Soft, gentle face with warm eyes; after awakening, her pupils turn into shimmering starlight color., Slender and graceful, about 160cm tall; a small glowing star-shaped mark appears on her wrist., wearing A simple white dress that falls to her knees, with faint star-pattern embroidery on the hem; no heavy accessories.\n暗影之首: No hair; the entire form is a swirling, conscious black mist., No visible mouth or nose; two narrow, elongated scarlet eyes glow from within the darkness, radiating malice., Amorphous; can condense into a tall humanoid silhouette with no solid mass, or attach to electronic devices; height and build are unstable, shifting like smoke., wearing No clothes; instead, dark mist and shadow fragments form an ever-shifting cloak around the figure.\n\n## 要求\n1. 根据剧本内容，将每个关键场景拆分为独立的分镜\n2. 每个场景的prompt必须用英文编写，格式为：\n   "anime style, [镜头类型], [场景环境描述], [角色外观描述], [动作/表情描述], [光影/氛围], high quality, detailed"\n3. 角色外观必须完整引用上面的参考信息\n4. 每个场景的dialogue字段填写该场景对应的台词，无台词则为空字符串\n5. 每集生成5到10个场景\n\n请直接输出JSON数组，不要包含其他文字。\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'n': 1, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.4}}
