ng in protest, her soft gentle face set in fierce determination, Lin Mo behind them looking conflicted and helpless in his worn plaid shirt and black-rimmed glasses, the shadow creature's dark mist looming in the blurred background, warm golden energy contrasting with cold dark mist, emotional dynamic atmosphere, high quality, detailed", '中景', 5, '小雨："不行！"\n夜影："还有一个办法。用我的守护之心作燃料，将通道永远封印。"', None, None, '47096a75d3f541f2a6e24ae9c427214b', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 36, "anime style, close-up shot, Xiao Yu a slender graceful young woman with long dark hair in a neat high ponytail with loose strands framing her face, tears welling up in her shimmering starlight-colored pupils, soft gentle face filled with anguish, Night Shadow the sleek black cat with short glossy black fur lifting his head to look up at her with gentle golden eyes, left ear with visible notch twitching, golden flames beginning to flicker faintly around the cat's entire body as he speaks softly, Lin Mo blurred in the background with a desperate expression, warm golden side lighting illuminating the cat while cooler blue tones fall on Xiao Yu, heartbreaking emotional atmosphere, cinematic bokeh, high quality, detailed", '近景', 7, '小雨："你会死的！"\n夜影："公主，我答应过陪你千年。可这一次，请让我任性一回。"', None, None, 'e31d1191fa3048ed894ec46eaffa6b16', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 37, "anime style, medium shot, Lin Mo a thin lanky programmer with messy short black hair unkempt and slightly overgrown, black-rimmed glasses and heavy dark circles under his tired but intense eyes, wearing a worn plaid shirt over a plain T-shirt, slamming his hands onto the keyboard with sudden fierce determination, sitting down firmly and typing rapidly at lightning speed, the computer screen casting bright green code light across his pale sallow face, Xiao Yu and Night Shadow watching him from behind with cautious hope, the shadow creature's dark mist pulling back slightly, mixed lighting of green monitor glow and warm room lamp, urgent action atmosphere, high quality, detailed", '中景', 5, '林默："不——一定有别的办法！"', None, None, 'aa6c566b7e944c51b7575263be75320a', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 38, "anime style, extreme close-up, the glowing computer monitor filled with lines of green code, a cursor blinking at the end of the final line, a close-up view of the keyboard with fingers pausing after typing the backdoor comment //if rain { cat.open(); }, the green text on the dark screen dominating the frame, Lin Mo's determined face faintly reflected in the glossy screen, his black-rimmed glasses and messy black hair visible at the bottom edge of the frame, electric green and black color palette, tense technological atmosphere, sharp crisp details, high quality, detailed", '特写', 5, '林默："你不是很熟我的代码吗？但你别忘了，我是作者。我给自己留了一扇后门。"', None, None, '481e77ad1f884c2391eaec5ed2bcf82d', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 39, 'anime style, medium shot, Night Shadow the sleek medium-sized black cat with short glossy black fur and golden vertical slit pupils staring at the screen with sharp amusement, a wry knowing look in his feline eyes, left ear with visible notch catching the light, Lin Mo at the desk with a tired but confident smirk on his pale sallow face, messy black hair and black-rimmed glasses reflecting the screen glow, his fingers still resting on the keyboard, Xiao Yu standing behind them with tear-streaked face and shimmering starlight-colored pupils showing faint hope, the monitor still glowing with code behind them, warm golden energy mixing with cool green light, hopeful yet tense atmosphere, high quality, detailed', '中景', 8, '夜影："凡人，你还真会玩。"\n林默："明日午时，我让这扇门变形。你就有机会趁虚而入，把它封死。"\n夜影："你确定能成功？"', None, None, '6ce3781b83e94a60a74b8a26a1904ef2', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 40, 'anime style, close-up shot, Lin Mo raising his head with a small determined smile despite the dark circles under his eyes, messy short black hair and black-rimmed glasses slightly askew, quiet confidence in his tired intense gaze as he speaks, Xiao Yu behind him with tears silently streaming down her gentle face, her starlight shimmering pupils glowing softly, one hand covering her lips as she watches him, Night Shadow the sleek black cat sitting beside them with calm golden flames beginning to surround his body, the first rays of morning sunlight breaking through the window and mixing with the fading darkness, cinematic emotional climax, golden hour lighting, high quality, detailed', '近景', 6, '林默："我是程序员，我从不写必死代码。"', None, None, '7de74ec4288c43019e454ea62c210b75', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 41, 'anime style, medium shot, a dimly lit rental room at noon with strangely darkened sky outside the window, Lin Mo, a thin pale young man with messy short black hair, heavy dark circles under his eyes, black-rimmed glasses, wearing a worn plaid shirt over a plain T-shirt, sits at a computer desk, one hand pressing the enter key, intense gaze at the screen, the screen filled with tangled black and golden code lines, cold blue screen light illuminating his face, high quality, detailed', '中景', 4, '现在！', None, None, '35f8c801254a4dfaaa2e59e32325b55d', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 42, 'anime style, close-up, a computer monitor displaying a black-hole-like swirling vortex, golden code fragments being sucked into the center, a conscious black mist with two narrow elongated scarlet eyes emerging from the screen, the form of the Shadow Sovereign condensing into a towering silhouette, digital glitch and electric sparks, cold dark room reflected in the glass, high quality, detailed', '近景', 5, '你怎么敢——！', None, None, '4629fca6eb3c4f5391b2c1edff4c754d', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 43, "anime style, close-up, Lin Mo's face with messy short black hair, pale sallow skin, heavy dark circles, black-rimmed glasses, a slight knowing smirk, eyes looking forward with confidence, in the background a glowing computer screen with black and gold code, dim room with cold screen light on his face, high quality, detailed", '近景', 6, '你太熟悉我的套路，但真正的程序员，从不会把后门写进注释里——注释是会骗人的。', None, None, '57fb811323ed40219abea8efdf044e50', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 44, 'anime style, medium shot, in a dim rental room, a sleek black cat with short glossy fur, golden vertical slit pupils and a notched left ear stands tensely on the desk, body beginning to glow faint gold, a slender young woman with long dark hair in a high ponytail and a white dress with faint star-pattern embroidery reaches out a hand to him, her eyes shimmering with starlight and worry, Lin Mo in the blurred background, dramatic low-key lighting, high quality, detailed', '中景', 5, '该我了。\n夜影……', None, None, '20746da2561347fb98b5c2717f1d8b0f', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 45, "anime style, close-up, a black cat with sleek short fur, golden vertical slit pupils, notched left ear gently presses his head against the palm of a young woman with long dark high ponytail and a star-shaped mark glowing on her wrist, her white dress hem with faint star embroidery visible, her eyes glistening with tears and soft starlight, the cat's expression gentle and final, warm dim lighting contrasting with cool shadows, high quality, detailed", '近景', 5, '公主，能再见到你，我已经没有遗憾。', None, None, '30c298ea7ee24704a0d6a247d474dfc8', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 46, 'anime style, wide shot, a chaotic bedroom, a black cat with golden flames engulfing its body leaps off a desk toward a computer monitor, transforming into a blazing golden comet, the monitor screen exploding into a swirling vortex, intense white light bursting outward, Lin Mo and a young woman in a white dress shielding their eyes in the background, papers and debris flying, contrast of black shadows and dazzling gold, high quality, detailed', '全景', 5, '', None, None, 'b22630e1dfff44e1ba0e77aeec2a9232', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 47, 'anime style, medium shot, aftermath in a dim rental room, shattered computer screen on the desk with smoke rising, a young woman in a white dress with a high ponytail kneels on the floor weeping, a thin young man with messy black hair and black-rimmed glasses stands holding a single black cat hair in his fingers, his eyes red and wet, a single black hair on the wooden table, gray melancholic light from the window, high quality, detailed', '中景', 6, '谢谢你，夜影。', None, None, '44d6409f7d1f4238a9be8d568ad078c9', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 48, 'anime style, wide shot, a bright game launch event venue, large stage screen displaying the key art of Rainy Night Cat with a black cat silhouette under rain, Lin Mo, with messy black hair and black-rimmed glasses, wearing a clean neat shirt, stands at a podium with a microphone, speaking emotionally with a gentle smile, in the front row a young woman with long dark high ponytail and a white dress with star-pattern embroidery applauds, her wrist star mark glowing faintly, audience silhouettes and stage lights, celebratory atmosphere, high quality, detailed', '全景', 6, '这个游戏，献给一只会说话的猫，和一个教会我勇敢的公主。', None, None, '7e5d3e37e607477391ca70c39d589910', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 49, 'anime style, medium shot, a large projection screen at a game launch event showing an animated rainy street at night, a sleek black cat with golden vertical slit pupils and a notched left ear leaps from a rooftop and lands on a fence, mouth open as if speaking, neon signs reflecting on wet pavement, raindrops flying, in the foreground blurred silhouettes of an audience laughing, vibrant night colors, high quality, detailed', '中景', 5, '凡人，这个BUG你永远改不完。', None, None, 'f756dd0f863d47ae94385f805da4e8b5', '8ad45d6c4e704b9288847500f2973209', None, 50, 'anime style, medium shot, late night office, a single warm desk lamp glowing, rain streaking down the window, Lin Mo, with messy short black hair and black-rimmed glasses, wearing a worn plaid shirt, stands at an open window leaning out, a faint golden light streak flashing across the dark rainy sky, his eyes determined and hopeful, cool blue night tones contrasted with warm lamplight, high quality, detailed', '中景', 5, '等着我，我去找你。', None, None)) completed
